Package: libcolord2
Version: @DEB_COLORD_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Depends: liblcms2-2, libglib2.0-0
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Description: system service to manage device colour profiles -- runtime
 colord is a system service that makes it easy to manage, install and generate
 colour profiles to accurately colour-manage input and output devices.
 .
 This package contains the libcolord client shared library. On iOS it is built
 client-only (no colord daemon, no udev) for the colour-profile lookups Mutter
 and gnome-settings-daemon make.
